					<div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2836">Olthar Othlinden</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2837">Tylendil</a></div>					
