					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														for all intersted Din and myself have now moved to Qeynos and are hunting in blackburrow... (we are sorta the core of the group with gnubin and horadur as people we prefer to group with often) It looks like it realy nice, I think I overestimated it cause last time I was there I was untwinked and it so much easier twinked						</td>
