						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														Oh, you WANT trains!  BB is excellent then.  And you have to, I mean HAVE TO do MM sometime.  Although those trains are hella-mean.  You probably won't have enough AE firepower for a big mistmoor train until 35+ (you could take yard-trash trains at 25 or 30).  All you have to do is attack one and let it run away, and the whole zone's gonna aggro.  I hear Unrest is legendary too, never went there.  <br />
<br />
I would think you could pull some nice trains in RE too at level 20 or so.						</td>
